# 06 — 网络（NeoForge 1.20.6）

来源：https://docs.neoforged.net/docs/1.20.6/networking/payload/

**本档不是 Forge SimpleChannel。** 用 `RegisterPayloadHandlersEvent`（复数 Handlers）+ `PayloadRegistrar` + `CustomPacketPayload`。

本档 TYPE 用 **`new ResourceLocation("mymod", "my_data")`**（官方示例），不是更晚档的 `ResourceLocation.fromNamespaceAndPath`。

文档写明：handler **在网络线程调用**；主线程逻辑用 `context.enqueueWork`。不要把邻档「默认主线程」抄过来。

```java
@SubscribeEvent // mod event bus
public static void register(final RegisterPayloadHandlersEvent event) {
    final PayloadRegistrar registrar = event.registrar("1");
    registrar.playBidirectional(
        MyData.TYPE,
        MyData.STREAM_CODEC,
        new DirectionalPayloadHandler<>(
            ClientPayloadHandler::handleData,
            ServerPayloadHandler::handleData));
}

public record MyData(String name, int age) implements CustomPacketPayload {
    public static final CustomPacketPayload.Type<MyData> TYPE =
        new CustomPacketPayload.Type<>(new ResourceLocation("mymod", "my_data"));
    public static final StreamCodec<ByteBuf, MyData> STREAM_CODEC = StreamCodec.composite(
        ByteBufCodecs.STRING_UTF8, MyData::name,
        ByteBufCodecs.VAR_INT, MyData::age,
        MyData::new);
    @Override
    public CustomPacketPayload.Type<? extends CustomPacketPayload> type() { return TYPE; }
}
```

另有 `playToClient` / `playToServer`，以及 `configuration*` / `common*`。发送：`PacketDistributor.sendToServer` / `sendToPlayer` / `sendToPlayersTrackingChunk` / `sendToAllPlayers`。

禁止：`SimpleChannel` / `IMessage` / `NetworkRegistry.newSimpleChannel`；把 `RegisterPayloadHandlerEvent`（单数）当本档事件名。
